-In project code should execute based on user operation. To satisfy user requirement, our code should execute based on some conditions.
-Using control statements, we can control program execution flow
-Control statements are divided into 3 types
1. Decision making statements/Conditional statements: if, if-else, if-else ladder, switch
2. Looping statements: while, do-while, for, for-each loop
3. Transfer/Branching statements: break, continue, return

Conditional statements:
