============================================================
1. DATA TYPES IN JAVA
============================================================

Java data types are classified into two categories:

1. Primitive Data Types
   - byte
   - short
   - int
   - long
   - float
   - double
   - char
   - boolean

2. Reference Data Types
   - Array
   - String
   - Class
   - Interface
