11. ITERATOR VS LISTITERATOR
============================================================

Iterator:
---------

- Supports forward traversal.
- Can be used with different Collection implementations.
- Supports element removal during iteration.

ListIterator:
-------------

- Supports forward and backward traversal.
- Can be used only with List implementations.
- Supports add(), set() and remove() operations.


